# CR 510.2, 603.2: Hypnotic Specter deals combat damage to the opponent, so
# its Mode$ DamageDone trigger fires. Defined$ TriggeredTarget is the damaged
# player (AbilityKey.Target, TriggerDamageDone.java:115), not the Specter's
# controller, so the opponent discards at random (Mode$ Random,
# DiscardEffect.java:183-198): the only card in their hand. The controller's
# own hand is untouched.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
resolvestack
